{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You will be the judge of the dead\u2026 and every choice will be remembered.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">I am Morta, your guide in this place. I will show you the tombs, the broken lives, and the voices that still echo in the dark. But the verdict is yours alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/extras/f62ac41ea1031e3e9e39da2ac37e0e0b.avif?t=1760131160\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luce Spenta</strong> is a gothic and psychological visual novel where power rests in your hands: you will decide the fate of five souls \u2014 forgiveness, reproach, oblivion, or execution.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 A gothic, dark atmosphere with detailed art and haunting soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f A moral journey that changes according to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 More than 25 different endings reflecting the weight of your judgments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Unexpected and disturbing moments that will test your will.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grave hides a sin, and every story stirs a different feeling: compassion, anger, rejection, melancholy.<br>As you move forward, <strong>Morta</strong> will guide you through this path of broken voices and shattered memories\u2026 and what you uncover will also reveal who you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Your choices carry weight.</strong></i><br><i><strong>The tombs await your decision.</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015120?t=1760131160","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/c6fc7fd6feeb0d239e71c0c8e78dd1aca1048a50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760131160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/6988ce32b9e6b17272ae658ba59379664b77699c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760131160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/6988ce32b9e6b17272ae658ba59379664b77699c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760131160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror themes, mild violence, and occasional disturbing imagery. There are brief suggestive poses of the main character, one scene with a character in underwear, and another where the same character appears deceased in underwear. This game touches sensible themes such as suicide, mental illness, corruption and murder. Some dialogue includes strong or insulting language. There are also a few jump scares and fourth-wall breaking sequences intended to unsettle the player. No explicit sexual activity or graphic violence is depicted."}