 gothic psychological visual novel where you must judge the fate of souls. Explore five graves, confront unsettling truths, and make decisions that will shape your path. Every choice is a reflection\u2026 and it has consequences.","steam_appid":4015120,"support_info":{"email":"morta.luxia@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}